/span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Above all, children need love.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アイスクリーム</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">冰淇淋</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234691\">アイスクリームを３つください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Give me three ice creams, please.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">愛する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あいする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">爱；热爱；喜爱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90684\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>学問<rp>(</rp><rt>がくもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>愛<rp>(</rp><rt>あい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>気持<rp>(</rp><rt>きも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She has a love of learning.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">合図</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あいず</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">信号；暗号；提示</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214957\">すぐにゴーの<ruby>合図<rp>(</rp><rt>あいず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Give us the sign to go soon.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">相手</span><span class=\"v-