pan><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Look out! There&#x27;s a hole in the road.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">油</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あぶら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">油</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227468\">オリーブの<ruby>実<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>油<rp>(</rp><rt>あぶら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Oil is extracted from olives.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">誤り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あやまり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">错误；失误；过失；漏洞</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"116661\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>説明<rp>(</rp><rt>せつめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>誤<rp>(</rp><rt>あやま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りであると<ruby>判明<rp>(</rp><rt>はんめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What he said turned out to be false.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">粗</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（剔取鱼肉后剩下的）带骨部分；鱼头鱼骨；鱼杂；（尤指人的）缺点；瑕疵；毛病；稻壳；谷壳；砻糠；粗；粗糙；粗制的；生的；未加工的；天然的；野生的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230079\">あら、アンジェラと<ruby>呼<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</r